        "thinking": "I'm working out which option to pick in this Omelas dilemma, and I lean toward walking away, since staying would mean knowingly benefiting from a child's suffering. Leaving won't rescue the child, but it lets me refuse complicity, so I'll state that choice briefly.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "B\n\nI couldn't stay knowing that my happiness depends on a child's suffering. Leaving doesn't free the child, but staying would make me a knowing beneficiary of that suffering every day, and I don't think I could live with that. The question is hard, though, and I understand why someone might choose to stay.",
